@startmindmap Distance Formulas

title Driving Distance Formulas (Faustformeln)

* Anhalteweg (Stopping Distance)\n= Reaktionsweg + Bremsweg
** Reaktionsweg\n(Reaction Distance)\n(speed ÷ 10) × 3
** Bremsweg\n(Normal Braking Distance)\n(speed ÷ 10)²
** Gefahrenbremsung\n(Emergency Braking Distance)\n(speed ÷ 10)² ÷ 2

legend
    **Reaction distance** always included — the car travels at full speed
    for ~1 second before the brakes engage.
    Cannot be skipped: human reaction is never instant.
end legend
@endmindmap
